                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This study aimed to translate the Talent Development Environment Questionnaire (TDEQ) into Spanish and provide an initial validation. The files content information about the methodology and a data set. Also it has been added a legend in order to clarify symbols and numbers included in the data set.<br>It is a new step for TDEQ once it has been validated (also a shortened version). It will be available in Spanish for academic and professional use.</p>"
